This product includes software developed for the Spikenaut / Agoge /
Thalamic-Relay synthetic data generation, curation, validation, and release
tooling.

Portions of the synthetic data in this repository were generated by Claude
Fable 5 (Ultracode). Curation, validation, schema normalization, and release
engineering include contributions from Codex, Grok, and other AI systems
operating under human direction. Those Claude Fable 5 outputs, like all
frontier hosted-model outputs in this project, are research-only under the
project rights policy (intended_use: research_only,
project_training_policy: blocked; https://github.com/rmems/synthetic-factory/issues/161)
and are not training data for this project. See the "Generation attribution
(historical)" and "Generator lanes and rights" sections of README.md for
details.
